  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Infraestructura Vial para la Competitividad Regional (PROREGION 2)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Road Infrastructure Program for Regional Competitiveness (PROREGION 2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general es contribuir a mejorar la competitividad e integracin econmica de las regiones del pas mediantela reduccin de los costos logsticos y la consolidacin regional de carga. El objetivo especfico es la mejora de la calidadde servicio de las vas intervenidas. El cumplimiento del objetivo del programa coadyuvar a la resiliencia de lainfraestructura al Cambio Climtico (CC).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective is to help improve the competitiveness and economic integration of the country&apos;s regions by reducing logistics costs and consolidating regional freight. The specific objective is to improve the quality of service of the targeted roads. Fulfillment of the general program objective will contribute to the resilience of infrastructure to climate change.</narrative>
  </description>
